     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Degree to which weather and climate data is integrated with HIS, for informed planning and decision-making using a Low, Medium, and High scale.</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Degree to which weather and climate data is integrated with HIS, for informed planning and decision-making using a Low, Medium, and High scale.

Scale definitions include: 
Low = priority climate-sensitive diseases and data sources identified

Medium = Climate/weather and HIS integration feasibility assessed + MoU signed between MoH and NMHS

High = database/dashboard or risk map developed to include climate variables and health information for at least one climate-sensitive diseases</narrative>
    </description>
